  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "tenebria-and-rhythm",
      "title": {
        "en": "Tenebria and Rhythm"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_srt4",
              "name": "Music, Start!",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre2",
              "name": "Rhythm: Crescendo",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre4",
              "name": "Rhythm: Fortissimo",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre5",
              "name": "Rhythm: Fermata",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Tenebria's gimmick is Music, Start! which Exhausts\nALL ALLY (Inlcudes self) BASIC ATTACKS not Basic Skills\nRegardless of how many Basics it exhausts you ALWAYS GET 6 Rhythms\n(Characters with 2 Basic Attacks save 40 FM, Characters with 1 only 20 FM)\nMain problem of Tenebria's Gimmick is how she adds/converts 6 extra cards\nThat means the Cycle Requirement of Tenebria teams is much higher then avg\nRhythm's created by Tenebria are all considered Basics\nThat means that Basic Potentials, Mei Move and Rei/Narja synergize"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Tenebria Arpeggio (EZ Mode)"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre10",
              "name": "Rhythm: Arpeggio",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre10",
              "name": "Rhythm: Arpeggio",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre10",
              "name": "Rhythm: Arpeggio",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre10",
              "name": "Rhythm: Arpeggio",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Only Rhythm version that stays only as Tenebria's cards\nIf you draw arp 0/1 you can chain into the rest of them\n0->1, 1->2&3, 2->3, 3->4/5, then you only need to draw 4/5 to finish all 6\nTotal AP = 1 (arp 2)\n1->0&2 0->3 2->3, 3->4/5, Total AP = 2 (arp 1&2)\nNia is really good at searching for arp 0&1 while also shuffling away for arp 3\nTLDR Arpeggio is actually only Cycle -2 and 1/2 AP"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1069_cre1",
              "name": "Rhythm",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
