        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Its just Arpeggio + Spotlight synergy\nJust play out your Arpeggios like normal\nThen when you Spotlight pick 5->4->1\nIt will force 1 into your hand, which you then can use to get 4&5\nIf the AP requirement of 1 is too high\nSpotlight 5->1->0\nDraws 0->1->5 0 AP required because of discount on Arp 1\nCnR is just here to help with early cycle + buff Arpeggio by counting as a 7th Rhythm\nYou will end up playing a total of 20 Rhythms, most of them being the Arpeggio 4/5"
          }
        },
