      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Ego Manifestation:"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E1:\nThis is so bad, 2.5 moral on 10 hits of a mid skill except in Chaos\nE2:\n2 Ego start of every fight, good in Chaos and Tower pretty mid elsewhere\nE3:\nEveryone's Idol? More like Everyone's letdown, since this EP skill is 7 cost (5 cuz E2)\nE4:\n30% Multi, is pretty nice, but nothing to spend over\nE5:\nTene actually has some pretty high base numbers, this isn't terrible\nE6:\nNow Ego is usuable! Yay! 40% Final Multi, boring but huge damage buff"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
